# Naming conventions (Scholar@UC)

Match **existing** names in the touched area. During the Hyrax upgrade, prefer extending existing Hyrax patterns over new namespaces.

## Files & directories

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Ruby source | `snake_case.rb` | `expiration_service.rb` |
| Spec | `<source>_spec.rb` | `expiration_service_spec.rb` |
| View / partial | `snake_case`; partials `_name.html.erb` | `_search_form.html.erb` |
| Concern file | `snake_case.rb` under `concerns/` | `works_controller_behavior.rb` |
| Rake | `snake_case.rake` under `lib/tasks/` | `fixity_check.rake` |
| Bin script | `snake_case`, no extension or `.rb` | `rspec-fast` |

**Autoload rule:** file path must match the constant (`ExpirationService` → `app/services/expiration_service.rb`; `GenericWork` → `app/models/generic_work.rb`).

## Classes, modules, namespaces

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Class | `PascalCase` | `GenericWork`, `WorkLoader` |
| Module | `PascalCase` | `Scholar`, `RemotelyIdentifiedByDoi` |
| Nested | `Parent::Child` | `Hyrax::CollectionTypes::PermissionsService` |
| Concern module | often `Feature::Name` or `*Behavior` | `Scholar::WorksControllerBehavior` |

**Legacy Hyrax work types:** singular model (`Article`, `StudentWork`); plural controller (`ArticlesController`, `StudentWorksController`).

## Methods, variables, parameters

- **Methods & locals:** `snake_case` (`apply_depositor_metadata`, `embargo_date`)
- **Predicates:** `name?` (`active?`)
- **Bang methods:** `name!` only when matching Rails/Hyrax semantics (save!, destroy!)
- **Blocks / yields:** descriptive `snake_case` (`|work|`, `|collection|`)
- **Unused args:** prefix `_` when RuboCop requires it

Do not use `camelCase` for Ruby identifiers.

## Constants

- Top-level config-style: `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` (`SLOW_SPEC_FILE_PATTERNS`)
- Module-scoped: `PascalCase` or `SCREAMING_SNAKE` inside the owning module—match neighbors in the same file

## Rails / Hyrax roles (legacy)

| Role | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Model | singular `PascalCase` | `GenericWork` |
| Controller | plural + `Controller` | `Hyrax::GenericWorksController` |
| Form | `Hyrax::<Model>Form` | `Hyrax::ArticleForm` |
| Presenter | `Hyrax::<Model>Presenter` or `WorkShowPresenter` | |
| Indexer | `<Model>Indexer` | `GenericWorkIndexer` |
| Job | `<Verb><Noun>Job` | `AttachFilesToWorkJob` |
| Service (app root) | `<Noun>Service`, `<Noun>Loader`, `<Noun>Report`, `<Noun>Factory` | `ExpirationService`, `WorkLoader` |
| Hyrax service | under `Hyrax::` module | `Hyrax::FixityCheckFailureService` |

## Valkyrie metadata (Phase B4+)

| Item | Pattern | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| Metadata YAML | `config/metadata/<type>.yaml` | `config/metadata/etd.yaml` |
| Shared UC fields | `config/metadata/uc_common.yaml` | included from each type schema |
| Work resource class | `PascalCase` | `Etd` (same as ActiveFedora model name) |
| Curation concern key | `snake_case` | `etd` in `config/initializers/hyrax.rb` |
| Spec (throwaway) | under `spec/throwaway/`, tag `throwaway: true` | |

Do not introduce new top-level namespaces without a note in `docs/upgrade/DECISIONS.md`.

## Config & environment

- App env vars: **`SCHOLAR_`** prefix (`SCHOLAR_FEDORA_URL`, `SCHOLAR_SOLR_URL`)
- Feature flags / paths: same prefix when added for this app

## Specs & metadata

- `:slow`, `:clean_repo`, `:throwaway` — lowercase symbols, as in `spec/support/slow_spec_metadata.rb`
- Factory names: `snake_case` (`:collection_lw`, `:generic_work_with_one_file`)

## Quick self-check

Before finishing a slice, confirm every **new or renamed** identifier:

1. File name ↔ constant/path alignment (Zeitwerk)
2. Singular model / plural controller (if Rails MVC)
3. All 8 work types keep existing model/controller names unless PLAN says otherwise
4. No stray camelCase or inconsistent pluralization
